<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/13th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · Campaign</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mongol invasion of Java</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">1292–1293</span> · <a href="/centuries/13th-century">13th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The Mongol invasion of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/java">Java</a> was a naval expedition sent by <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kublai-khan">Kublai Khan</a> of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/yuan-dynasty">Yuan Dynasty</a> in 1292 to 1293. The Javanese prince <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/raden-wijaya">Raden Wijaya</a> used the Mongol force against his rival and then turned on the invaders, driving them out. He went on to found the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/majapahit-empire">Majapahit Empire</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mongol-invasion-of-java.jpg" alt="Mongol invasion of Java" width="316" height="420" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Akinneyfluorse · CC BY 4.0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mongol_invasion_of_java_(map).png" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
